Subject: [15] Compare Shostak symbol names directly, full 64-variable proof

Measurement: 420 → 406 ms. 756 → 733 MB. A synthetic 2,048-symbol sum took 249 → 41 ms and 201 MB → 98 KB.

diff --git a/src/ground-prover/interface.lisp b/src/ground-prover/interface.lisp
index 7c3f4b6..5b7a576 100644
--- a/src/ground-prover/interface.lisp
+++ b/src/ground-prover/interface.lisp
@@ -205,7 +205,9 @@
 
 
 (defun alphalessp (a b)
-  (string< (string a) (string b)))
+  ;; Comparing symbol names directly avoids widening them in STRING on SBCL.
+  (string< (if (symbolp a) (symbol-name a) a)
+           (if (symbolp b) (symbol-name b) b)))
 
